{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764438,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"The Fun Psych Game Show 6.0","festival_id":520580,"organization_id":723,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-07T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/the-fun-psych-game-show-60-catharsis-2026-jesus-and-mary-college-jmc-du-delhi-1764438","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Pavlov rang the bell, Freud left a clue. Your brain's the suspect, so what will you do?<\/p>\n<p>The Department of Psychology of Jesus and Mary College, University of Delhi is thrilled to invite all psychology lovers to join us for the FUN PSYCH GAME SHOW 6.0, the ultimate psychology quiz, as a part of our annual academic day, CATHARSIS'26, on 8th October 2026. So get ready for a day filled with exciting challenges, unexpected twists, fun surprises, and lots of psych trivia.<\/p>\n<p>This time, the clues aren't as innocent as they seem.<\/p>\n<p>Find the Ryan to your Deci, your partner in crime, and put your perception, attention and psychological reasoning to the test!<\/p>\n<p>The winning team will receive exciting prizes and certificates.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 8 October 2026<\/li>\n<li>Day: Thursday<\/li>\n<li>Venue: Thevenet Hall, Jesus and Mary College<\/li>\n<li>Time: 1 - 3 PM<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all undergraduate students across universities in Delhi NCR.<\/li>\n<li>All rounds will be related to psychology.<\/li>\n<li>Only pairs allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Multiple entries from a single institute are allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Teams can consist of members from different institutions.<\/li>\n<li>Last date to register is 6th October 11:59 pm.<\/li>\n<li>Registration fee: Rs 100 per team.<\/li>\n<li>Registration fees will be collected from 11.30 - 12.30. Failure to pay the registration fees will 